      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَائِتٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَيِّتٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ مَائِتٌ فى الغَمِّ</span>
(tropical:)  [<i>Such a one is dying,</i> or <i>absorbed, in grief</i>].
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْتٌ مَائِتٌ</span> <i>A severe, painful,</i> or
<i>violent, death:</i> (TA:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْلٌ لَائِلٌ</span>: the
latter word being added to corroborate the
former. (S.)

